        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>驾驶证考试要点笔记 52-60</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 26px 22px 40px 22px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .item {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .head {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .num {\n    color: #cc2200;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .tag {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .red {\n    color: #cc2200;\n  }\n  .redb {\n    color: #cc2200;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .l1 { margin-left: 34px; }\n  .l2 { margin-left: 62px; }\n  .l3 { margin-left: 96px; }\n  .l4 { margin-left: 120px; }\n  .sub {\n    margin-left: 34px;\n  }\n  .listline {\n    margin-left: 90px;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    color: rgba(200,190,150,0.55);\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    transform: rotate(-30deg);\n    pointer-events: none;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .wm1 { top: 210px; left: 300px; }\n  .wm2 { top: 330px; left: 340px; }\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 90px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #999;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #ccc;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"watermark wm1\">科目一考试</div>\n  <div class=\"watermark wm2\">科目一考试</div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">52:</span>【文明驾驶题】题目中有 <span class=\"redb\">\"依次\"</span>，答对。选择题:选项中有依次，直接选</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">53:</span>【文明驾驶题】<span class=\"redb\">\"减速\"</span>跟 <span class=\"redb\">\"确认安全\"</span> <span class=\"redb\">\"应当\"</span> <span class=\"redb\">√</span> <span class=\"redb\">\"应当\"</span>，应当+两两 <span class=\"redb\">×</span></div>\n    <div class=\"l1\">判断题:题目中有确认安全，答对。选择题:选项中一个确认安全直接选，两个确认</div>\n    <div class=\"l1\">安全选带减速或低速的。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">54:</span>【文明驾驶题】判断题:凡是见到判断题里有<span class=\"redb\">\"\"</span>（双引号）的就答 <span class=\"redb\">√</span></div>\n    <div class=\"l3\">判断题:题目中有 <span class=\"redb\">礼让</span>，答对。选择题:选项 中有礼让，直接选。</div>\n    <div class=\"l3\">判断题:题目中有 <span class=\"redb\">避免</span>，答对。不避让，答错。</div>\n    <div class=\"l3\">判断题:题目中有 <span class=\"redb\">主动</span>，答对。选择题:选项中有主动，直接选。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">55:</span>【文明驾驶题】<span class=\"redb\">关键词:减速、靠右依次</span></div>\n    <div class=\"l1\">判断题:题目中有减速、靠右或靠右、减速，答对。</div>\n    <div class=\"l1\">选择题:选项中有减速、靠右或靠右、减速，直接选。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">56:</span>【文明驾驶题】　<span class=\"redb\">关键词:减速、停车</span>　选择题:选项中减速、停车，直接选。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">57:</span>【文明驾驶题】　<span class=\"redb\">关键词:安全距离</span></div>\n    <div class=\"l1\">选择题:选项中有一个安全距离直接选，两个安全距离选带大字的。</div>\n    <div class=\"l1\"><span class=\"redb\">关键词:加速</span>　判断题:题目中有加速，答错(<span class=\"red\">加速过急除外</span>)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">58:</span>【违法行为】</div>\n    <div class=\"l1\">判断题:<span class=\"redb\">违法行为</span>，答 <span class=\"redb\">√</span> ;没有违法答<span class=\"redb\">×</span>违章行为，答<span class=\"redb\">×</span></div>\n    <div class=\"l1\">选择题:题目中属于什么行为?直接选违法行为。</div>\n    <div class=\"l2\">问 <span class=\"redb\">\"几种违法行为\"</span> 选 <span class=\"redb\">\"三种违法行为\"</span></div>\n    <div class=\"l2\"><span class=\"redb\">关键词:</span>可可选不、可可可选non、未末未选其他。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">59:</span>【新能源/电动】</div>\n    <div class=\"sub\" style=\"margin-left:0;\">题中见: 电动汽车答 <span class=\"redb\">√</span> ，同时出现无需、频繁刹车答<span class=\"redb\">×</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"num\">60:</span>【急救伤员题】</div>\n    <div class=\"red\" style=\"margin-left:0;\">看到【中毒】要<span class=\"redb\">撤离、转移</span>，原地等待不是救援，是 <span class=\"redb\">原地等死</span>。</div>\n    <div class=\"red listline\" style=\"margin-left:56px;\">【昏迷】首先要检查是否有<span class=\"redb\">呼吸脉搏</span></div>\n    <div class=\"red listline\" style=\"margin-left:56px;\">【骨折】不要移动，用<span class=\"redb\">三角巾</span>固定 3-4 人平移<span class=\"redb\">硬担架</span></div>\n    <div class=\"red listline\" style=\"margin-left:56px;\">【失血】先<span class=\"redb\">止血</span>，止血从源头止，<span class=\"redb\">近心端动脉</span></div>\n    <div class=\"red listline\" style=\"margin-left:56px;\">【全身烧伤】喷冷水灭火</div>\n    <div class=\"red listline\" style=\"margin-left:56px;\">【烧伤口渴】可喝<span class=\"redb\">淡盐水</span>，只喝白开水 100 度答<span class=\"redb\">×</span></div>\n    <div class=\"red listline\" style=\"margin-left:56px;\">【烧伤起泡】用<span class=\"redb\">保鲜膜覆盖</span>，避免感染</div>\n    <div class=\"red listline\" style=\"margin-left:56px;\">【包扎】不能使用<span class=\"redb\">麻绳</span>，错误选项，选麻绳</div>\n    <div class=\"red listline\" style=\"margin-left:56px;\">【昏迷伤】员搬运需<span class=\"redb\">侧卧</span>，仰卧分泌物误入气管，会有窒息危险</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:60px;height:22px;\">[Logo: 小红书 水印, bottom-center]</div>\n    <div>@驾考号:3859943375</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
